  "title": "Cantor8: Enterprise Infrastructure for Canton Network",
  "text_sample": "Cantor8: Enterprise Infrastructure for Canton Network Home Products Company Partners Careers Contact Media Official Blog Newsroom Stay in touch LinkedIn, Cantor8 X (Twitter), Cantor8 X (Twitter), C8 Wallet Home Products Partners News Blog Career Company Get in Touch Close Menu Enterprise-Grade Infrastructure on Canton Get in Touch scroll down FOUNDATION Built for Institutional Workflows From issuance to execution within a single configurable system Cantor8 delivers a unified infrastructure layer for institutions operating on Canton, combining asset issuance, custody and execution within a single configurable system. Each component is modular and designed for control, enabling institutions to define workflows, permissions and execution logic while integrating seamlessly with existing financial systems. The Company Trusted by industry leaders Our partnerships extend beyond research. We actively support open-source development, fund innovation initiatives and host lectures, hackathons and events designed to connect technical talent with real-world financial challenges. This approach ensures that the systems we build are grounded in both academic rigour and operational reality. Product",
